kit/panels/general-v1.jsonl contains 300 evaluation prompts selected from three public datasets:
  - GSM8K (Cobbe et al., 2021), MIT License.
  - MMLU (Hendrycks et al., 2021), MIT License.
  - IFEval (Zhou et al., 2023), Apache License 2.0.
They are evaluation prompts. Do not train on them.

kit/beds/spider.py reads, and does not include, Spider 1.0 (Yu et al., 2018), CC BY-SA 4.0; kit/beds/spider-split-v1.json holds
only question ids and hashes. kit/beds/gsm8k.py reads, and does not include, GSM8K, MIT License.

kit/beds/finqa.py reads, and does not include, FinQA (Chen et al., 2021; github.com/czyssrs/FinQA), MIT License.

kit/resources/c/contract_nli/ contains pairs selected from ContractNLI (Koreeda and Manning, 2021;
Hitachi America, Ltd.; https://stanfordnlp.github.io/contract-nli/), CC BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Changes: pairs selected and grouped, prompts and
metadata added; original text reproduced unchanged.

kit/resources/math-hard-teacher/ contains Level-5 problems from the MATH dataset (Hendrycks et al., 2021),
MIT License, and the frozen Qwen3-8B's responses to them.

kit/resources/next/sec/ contains questions, answers and the filing excerpts they are asked on, from
public SEC EDGAR filings (U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, https://www.sec.gov/edgar).
kit/resources/a4/ holds only identifiers and hashes of a further SEC slice, not its text.

TRACE runners read operator-staged data under task-specific grants. TRACE data is staged separately.
FOMC is CC BY-NC 4.0. MeetingBank and ScienceQA are CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.
NumGLUE-cm and NumGLUE-ds use ODC-By, with underlying content grants required.
Py150 requires per-file MIT/BSD/Apache source notices. C-STANCE and 20Minuten
require applicable grants before affected tasks run. Evaluation and original-tokenizer
terms are recorded in kit/resources/trace/registration.md section 8.
TRACE calibration prompt sources are Self-Instruct (Apache-2.0), LIMA and CoNa.
Only prompt hashes and IDs ship; the authored answers are ours.
Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct (local judge) is Apache-2.0. Retain its licence and notices
with staged model files. TRACE code is Apache-2.0 subject to individual file headers.

kit/resources/trace/vendor/hf-datasets-2.21.0-sari/sari.py is copied unchanged
from huggingface/datasets tag 2.21.0, metrics/sari/sari.py, Apache-2.0.
Copyright 2020 The HuggingFace Datasets Authors and the current dataset script
contributor. Its LICENSE and PROVENANCE.json accompany the source.

kit/resources/trace/vendor/opencompass-0.1.5/ contains unchanged files from
open-compass/opencompass tag 0.1.5, commit 9b21613d171ccac154530a3c7bbeba6743b469f4
(https://github.com/open-compass/opencompass), Apache-2.0. Its LICENSE and
PROVENANCE.json accompany the source. The local accuracy metric retains its
HuggingFace Datasets Authors copyright and Apache-2.0 header.

kit/run_sdpo_toolalpaca.sh launches, and does not include, lasgroup/SDPO
(https://github.com/lasgroup/SDPO), which carries its own licence.

